  "title": "Cranberry-Blueberry Sauce",
  "description": "This maple syrup-sweetened cranberry sauce with fresh blueberries is flavored with orange, zesty ginger, allspice, and cinnamon and tastes delicious over hot oatmeal or pancakes!",
  "authors": [
    "Kerri C"
  ],
